  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Rinse the sea bass fillets under cold water and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together olive oil, lemon juice, ginger, black pepper, and garlic powder (if using).",
    "Place the sea bass fillets in a baking dish and brush the mixture evenly over both fillets.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Bake for 12-15 minutes or until the fish is cooked through and flakes easily with a fork.",
    "Remove from oven and garnish with chopped fresh parsley (if using).",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
